  "description": "The one credential store OmnibusCloud hosts share: a file-backed envelope protected at rest by the platform keystore — DPAPI (Windows), the login Keychain (macOS), the freedesktop Secret Service via libsecret (Linux) — with an honestly-marked, user-only-file-mode plaintext fallback where no keystore is reachable, and fail-closed reads. Extracted from OutWit.Cloud.Auth so the managed SDK, the native SDK (oc_credentials_*) and every host persist sign-in through one audited component; AOT-compatible.",
